# sentence_id = 355
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = Since we have gifts that differ according to the grace given to us: if prophecy, let us use it in proportion to our faith; if service, let us use it in service; if teaching, let us use it in teaching; if encouragement, let us use it in encouragement; the one who gives, let him give with generosity; the one who leads, with diligence; the one who shows mercy, with cheerfulness.
# literal_translation = Having but gifts according to the grace that given to us differing, whether prophecy [let us use it] according to the proportion of the faith, whether service [let us use it] in the service, whether the one teaching [let him be] in the teaching, whether the one exhorting [let him be] in the exhortation, the one giving in simplicity, the one leading in diligence, the one showing mercy in cheerfulness.
